{"id":"vod_bf_79096","vodId":"79096","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"Overiord第三季","name_cn":"Overiord第三季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20241127-1/7c8cd25b891d7d9191b9b0a1e745836d.jpg"},"summary":"时间为2138年。曾卷起一大风潮的虚拟现实体感型网络游戏《YGGDRASIL》即将迎来停服。玩家飞鼠在曾经以同伴和荣华自傲的根据地纳萨力克地下大坟墓，独自一人安静等待着那一刻。　　但是，不料发生了“过了结束时间却还没有登出”的异常事态。NPC们开始以自己的意志行动，不止如此，纳萨力克之外展开了从未见过的异世界。飞鼠为了寻找过去的同伴，以公会名安兹·乌尔·恭自称，决定在异世界扬名立万。他与宣誓绝对忠诚的部下一同，向新的地域进军。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-27 13:22:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/busizhezhiwangdisanji/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:48:52.399Z"}